    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312490/extras/b3e2f45e40a0ecf98eb03185d2f82320.avif?t=1747608499\" /></span><br><strong>Beaming Stingray</strong> is an approachable and fluid shoot 'em up about time and aging. Soraya's life hangs in the balance following a reckless act of revenge. Can she find peace with the <i>time</i> she has left?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT ALONGSIDE YOURSELF</h2>Fill Soraya's <strong>TimeStone</strong> by absorbing green time-bullets and play alongside past versions of yourself. Double up on a shielded enemy to expose a weak point or dance together with your <i>time ghost</i> to rack up combos that would be impossible in linear time. With forward-thinking strategy, many ghosts can be stacked for truly dizzying action. Exploiting the possibilities of the TimeStone is key to your success and your survival.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312490/extras/2e290fc3ca37a91be6d2050ca3fcedb0.poster.avif?t=1747608499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312490/extras/2e290fc3ca37a91be6d2050ca3fcedb0.webm?t=1747608499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312490/extras/2e290fc3ca37a91be6d2050ca3fcedb0.mp4?t=1747608499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BRAIN-BENDING ACTION</h2>Face complex, puzzle-like bosses and string together three enemies of the same color/symbol to net a score-amplifying <strong>COMBO</strong>. Maintaining a <i>COMBO</i> throughout an entire level requires multiple play sessions, thoughtful strategy, and multi-ghost coordination.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312490/extras/276ce3069cf137cbb600050702a9b0f1.poster.avif?t=1747608499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312490/extras/276ce3069cf137cbb600050702a9b0f1.webm?t=1747608499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312490/extras/276ce3069cf137cbb600050702a9b0f1.mp4?t=1747608499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FLY WITH POWER AND GRACE</h2><strong>Dash and back blast</strong> between walls of bullets as you take out waves of tanks and war machines. The little Deity you fly has a unique move set that enables creativity and rapid-fire damage dealing. Shooting at point-blank range does double damage and ending a combo with a back blast will net you a <i>COMBO+</i> for extra points and a TimeStone boost.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312490/extras/b7df30d7f700748ad4750b46f1929106.poster.avif?t=1747608499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312490/extras/b7df30d7f700748ad4750b46f1929106.webm?t=1747608499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312490/extras/b7df30d7f700748ad4750b46f1929106.mp4?t=1747608499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SAVE THE ANIMALS</h2>The Raeshah Revolutionary Army (RRA) has captured many of the <strong>mystical creatures</strong> in the land. Find a way to free them and they might just <i>return the favor</i>. Saving all of the animals unlocks a secret level and minigame inside of Soraya's mind...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312490/extras/bf83fc71cd302e67dd138bc445c314be.poster.avif?t=1747608499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312490/extras/bf83fc71cd302e67dd138bc445c314be.webm?t=1747608499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312490/extras/bf83fc71cd302e67dd138bc445c314be.mp4?t=1747608499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
