tras/bf83fc71cd302e67dd138bc445c314be.poster.avif?t=1747608499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312490/extras/bf83fc71cd302e67dd138bc445c314be.webm?t=1747608499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312490/extras/bf83fc71cd302e67dd138bc445c314be.mp4?t=1747608499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
